                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill refers to the Joint Note, article 5, and asks what material is used
                    exclusively in the manufacture of arms and ammunition, and calls attention to
                    the fact that ammunition is not prohibited. * * *)</p>
            </div>
